      "json": [
        {
          "text": "Trickery is something the fey are known for. It's true, this decoy will "
        },
        {
          "text": "create an illusory double",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " of me that will run forward. It can "
        },
        {
          "text": "draw the attention of enemies",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " that seek to do me harm, and is more likely to do so with a higher magnitude. This component will cause all further components within the spell to affect the decoy rather than the original target. \n\nThis can only be crafted by those allied with the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Fey Courts",
          "color": "dark_green"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
